{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111076","id":2874977706,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rXK2q","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111076","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111076.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111076.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111076","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111076/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111076/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111076/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/afb418c412a24f92c5a4474783df6f0b6300eea9","number":111076,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix CharacterBody2D `move_and_slide()` treats wall as floor","user":{"login":"dasasdhba","id":63804597,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzODA0NTk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63804597?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dasasdhba","html_url":"https://github.com/dasasdhba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dasasdhba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dasasdhba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dasasdhba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dasasdhba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dasasdhba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dasasdhba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dasasdhba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dasasdhba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dasasdhba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #111059\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8d8041bd4dab30e51ecf5be21dc7bf1f6a26c039/scene/2d/physics/character_body_2d.cpp#L183-L200\r\n\r\nLine 188-193 may cancel a recovery motion, so that another recovery collision would be reported in line 195 `_snap_on_floor(true, false, true)`, which may eventually treat a vertical wall as floor, just as the issue shown. \r\n\r\nFurthermore, I think recovery collision is not necessary in this case. Since we have called `move_and_collide` before, it should be safe in theory. That is, ignoring recovery collision here will resolve the issue.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure whether this solution will affect anything else, let me know if it will, thanks!","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","f